{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10284220","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10284220","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1028422001:1":{"text":"These prints look completely different from the Harvesters'! Certainly, they belong to someone else!","source_cn":"这里的脚印，和采集队成员的脚印完全不同！是另一种足迹！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F661CE83F66DA58","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1028422002:1":{"text":"One person's steps are large, and their feet appear to point outward. The other takes small, awkward steps.","source_cn":"一个人步伐很大，走路有点外八字；另一个似乎步伐比较小，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90AEDB3BF5E688DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1028422002":{"text":"One person's steps are large, and their feet appear to point outward. The other takes small, awkward steps.","source_cn":"一个人步伐很大，走路有点外八字；另一个似乎步伐比较小，感觉走得踉踉跄跄的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90AEDB3BF5E688DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028422003:2":{"text":"What's odd is that their tracks end here. They neither continue nor double back...","source_cn":"奇怪，他们的脚印在这里消失了……没有往回走，也没有去别...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA45A004A5D0C0BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028422004:1":{"text":"Maybe they were chased by a hypofiend and had to climb the tree!","source_cn":"难道被怪物追赶，到这里无路可跑，所以不得不爬到了树上！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADE175B9B300447E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028422005:1":{"text":"Hey! Up above! Is anyone there?!","source_cn":"喂——上面——有人吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEF7D205B81C9247","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028422006:1":{"text":"No, the moss on the tree is still intact, with no signs of climbing.","source_cn":"不对，树干上的青苔都很完整，没有被踩踏或者蹭掉的痕迹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83A1DE4E6B26EAC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028422007:2":{"text":"...Where could they have gone?","source_cn":"……他们究竟去了哪里呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x207F48A4A06FA641","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1028422007":{"text":"...Where could they have gone?","source_cn":"……他们究竟去了哪里呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x207F48A4A06FA641","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1028422008:0":{"text":"In general, people don't just disappear without a trace!","source_cn":"漫漫能肯定，人是不会凭空消失的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03150FDD8E618AF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1028422008":{"text":"In general, people don't just disappear without a trace!","source_cn":"漫漫能肯定，人是不会凭空消失的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03150FDD8E618AF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1028422009:1":{"text":"Huh?! This tree has a hidden entrance!","source_cn":"这棵树……居然是个隐秘的入口！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33926FED612A139D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1028422010:0":{"text":"Let me take a look... ohh, it's so dark inside! I wonder where it leads.","source_cn":"我看看……呀，里面好黑啊！不知道通往什么地方……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC7575927D2B1499","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1028422011:1":{"text":"Hammie, are you scared? Don't worry, you can hide behind my shield!","source_cn":"漫漫害怕了吗？别担心，你可以躲到我的盾牌后面！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE90227756D4FBC3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say: